[Achievements]

I am pleased to highlight some of our key achievements for the period:

Â We met the Constitutional timeline for submitting financial audit reports to Parliament and County Assemblies by 31 December 2024, having certified 2,746 public entities' accounts;

Â We received an Unmodified (clean) audit opinion on our financial statements for the Financial Year 2023/2024;

Â The Office implemented the Performance Management System to ensure optimum staff performance;

Â We tracked and reported to Parliament on the implementation status of Parliamentary Oversight Committees' recommendations, a milestone in assessing our impact;

Â The Office achieved ISO/IEC 27001 certification, marking a significant milestone that highlights our commitment to protecting sensitive data and information;

Â We successfully upgraded and customized the Audit Management System (AMS) to align with the revised Audit Methodology and International Standards of Supreme Audit Institutions (ISSAIs) to improve efficiency of our processes;

